{"id":"644816","name":"宁波醉蚶","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/644816/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"血蚶","amount":"600克"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜粒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：血蚶（已洗净）、姜粒。","img":"images/644816/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"接着，倒入刚刚烧开的开水没过血蚶。","img":"images/644816/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"盖上盖，泡上十几秒。","img":"images/644816/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"然后，开盖、将水倒掉。","img":"images/644816/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"最后，搁入姜粒，加适量的生抽。","img":"images/644816/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加适量的料酒。","img":"images/644816/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量的零卡糖。","img":"images/644816/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/644816/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖上盖、浸泡2小时以后可以吃吃了。","img":"images/644816/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}